OL,11,G2320 Gary Moore: One Night In Dublin
OL,12,     FGary Moore is joined on stage by
OL,13,     FBrian Robertson, Scott Gorham and
OL,14,     FEric Bell in an electrifying gig
OL,15,     Fin honour of their former Thin
OL,16,     FLizzy bandmate Phil Lynott, who
OL,17,     Fdied in 1986.
